@startuml CPN-16-tracking-value-based
title CPN-16 — Flux valeur -> dataLayer -> providers pub (value-based)

skinparam shadowing false
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center

participant "Moteur prix\n(resolveProductPricing / computePromo)" as Engine
participant "getKitLeadValue\n(public.ts, server-auth)" as Lead
participant "Page /kit\n(view_item)" as Page
participant "Wizard / Snapshot\n(add_to_cart, begin_checkout)" as Cart
participant "Commande\n(purchase)" as Order
participant "dataLayer (GTM)\nparams.value (MAD)" as DL
participant "Meta CAPI / Pixel\n+ Google Ads" as Providers

== Source unique de la value ==
Engine -> Engine : effectivePriceCents = 19900 (coupon actif treatment)
note right of Engine
  Source de la value = prix PAYÉ
  treatment -> 19900 ; holdout -> 28900
end note

== view_item (/kit) ==
Page -> Engine : computePromo(28900, 19900)
Engine --> Page : effectivePriceCents = 19900
Page -> DL : view_item { value: 19900/100 = 199, currency: 'MAD' }

== generate_lead (chat / contact) ==
Cart -> Lead : getKitLeadValue()
Lead --> Cart : { value: 199, currency: 'MAD' }
Cart -> DL : generate_lead { value: 199 }

== add_to_cart / begin_checkout ==
Cart -> Cart : snapshot.totalCents = 19900 (CPN-07)
Cart -> DL : add_to_cart / begin_checkout { value: 199 }

== purchase (commande confirmée) ==
Order -> Order : order.totalCents = 19900 (repricé, CPN-08)
Order -> DL : purchase { value: 19900/100 = 199, currency: 'MAD' }

== Propagation providers ==
DL -> Providers : value = 199 (unité majeure)
note over DL, Providers #DDEFD8
  GATE G-TRACKING-VALUE ✔
  Toutes surfaces : value = 199
  JAMAIS 289 (barré) ni 19900 (centimes)
  Cohérence view_item == add_to_cart == purchase
  Invariance : promo statique OU coupon -> 199
end note

note over Providers #F6D9D4
  Régression interdite :
  - value=289 -> Meta sur-évalue -> bid trop haut -> CPA réel dégradé
  - value=19900 -> value ×100 -> ROAS faux
end note

@enduml
